<title>SOUTH AFRICA: POLL - South African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>POLL - South African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY--PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>THU  Cadswep  H1 EPS  17.4	 17.2-17.6	146.6</p>
<p>THU  Cadswep  H1 DIV  3.44	 3.4-3.5	   29.0</p>
<p>THU  Stocks   YR EPS  61.0	 57.0-63.0	 69.0</p>
<p>THU  Stocks   YR DIV  14.0	 11.0-15.0	 15.0</p>
<p>NOTE:- Cadbury Schweppes SA Ltd launched a 10-for-one share split, diluting earnings per share for last year by a factor of 10.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
